bbText = "•This door leads to GODDESS
 TEMPLE....but it's locked by magic. 
•Do you wish to know more?
•Welcome to these cursed lands.
•Entities of old magic, pixies,
 sprites, witches have lived here
 for ages in harmony. 
•However, a powerful priestess,
 by corrupting the teachings of
 our GODDESS, has brought blight
 upon our land.
•In order to unlock the door,
 you must collect 100
 crystal cubes,
•it seems you have some already..
•Venture forth, and talk to
 every being you see, for
 they may be able to help your quest.
•PLEASE!!! Help us traveler!
Do not turn your back on us! "
